2.0 PROBLEM FORMULATION

2.1 Problem Statement (A1)
UiTM students may face difficulties in managing their assignments, deadlines, and   class attendance through the existing uFuture platform. Students need to open different course pages to check their academic tasks and attendance information, making it difficult to view everything in one place.
Based on personal observation, students sometimes forget to mark their attendance on uFuture and need to contact their lecturers after missing the attendance check-in. In addition, students may find it difficult to identify which assignments need attention first because deadlines are displayed separately across different courses.
These issues may cause students to miss important academic activities, spend more time navigating between course pages, and experience difficulties in managing their academic responsibilities efficiently.

